{%- comment -%}
  The Oh Betty Jaletti house mark, drawn to the brand artwork: four circles
  at 50 ±26.39 with radius 18.11, punched by a centre circle of 12.14, in #333045.
  The outer extent is 44.5 of 50, the canvas convention the theme already
  used, so the mark renders at the same size as before. The file keeps its
  historical name so render calls and the existing sizing rules stay stable.
{%- endcomment -%}
<svg class="icon-obj-monogram" viewBox="0 0 100 100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
  <mask id="objMonoQfHole">
    <rect width="100" height="100" fill="white"/>
    <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="12.14" fill="black"/>
  </mask>
  <g mask="url(#objMonoQfHole)" fill="#333045">
    <circle cx="50" cy="23.61" r="18.11"/>
    <circle cx="23.61" cy="50" r="18.11"/>
    <circle cx="76.39" cy="50" r="18.11"/>
    <circle cx="50" cy="76.39" r="18.11"/>
  </g>
</svg>
